  "releaseNotes": "Up to 5 Photos per Task\nYou can now add up to 5 photos as proof of task completion. Use multiple photos to show before-and-after results, capture different steps, or provide a clearer view of the completed task.\n\nNew Task Icons\nWe've added new icons based on requests from our users, making it easier to personalize tasks and choose the icon that best fits each activity.\n\nBoth improvements were created with your feedback in mind, helping make NeatKid more flexible and convenient for everyday use.",
